This License grants limited copyright and binary execution permissions only. **No patent license, whether express, implied, by estoppel, or under the doctrine of exhaustion, is granted by this Agreement** under any patent or patent application (including without limitation Canadian Patent Applications, international patent applications, and counterparts). Any implementation, clean-room re-implementation, or derivative work practicing the claimed methods requires a separate written Patent License from the Licensor.

### SHIELD 3 — ANTI-REVERSE ENGINEERING, ANTI-DECOMPILATION & BINARY INTEGRITY LOCK
With respect to any pre-compiled shared library (`.so`, `.dylib`, `.dll`) or binary executable included in the Software, You shall not, and shall not permit any third party to: (a) disassemble, decompile, decrypt, extract micro-architectural lookup tables, or reverse engineer the binary code; (b) bypass, disable, nop-out, patch, or tamper with any binary integrity check or concurrency limiter; or (c) use symbolic execution, dynamic binary instrumentation, or side-channel probing to reconstruct internal algorithms.

